<body>

  <%- include('header') %>
  <script>
    $(document).ready(function() {
      $('.navbar-toggler').click(function() {
        $('#navbarNav').collapse('toggle');
      });
    });
  </script>


    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="relative bg-[#011d3b] text-white py-24 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">Empowering Your <span class="text-blue-400">Movement</span></h1>
                <p class="text-lg text-blue-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">At Movement Science, we don't just treat symptoms; we restore lives. Our expert-led physiotherapy is rooted in science and delivered with compassion, helping you regain the freedom to move without pain.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dad99901?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=2070" alt="Physiotherapy session" class="rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white/10">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -mr-32 -mt-32"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="bg-white py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#011d3b] mb-6">Meet Akshay: Our Lead Specialist</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Akshay is a highly qualified physiotherapist who practiced in India before relocating to the UK to pursue his Master's degree at Salford University. He is a professional physiotherapist registered with HCPC and MCSP, specializing in neurological conditions, cardiorespiratory issues, and musculoskeletal problems, with over 10+ years of clinical experience.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Under Akshay's leadership, Movement Science offers specialized home visits for those who prefer treatment in the comfort of their own homes. Our primary objective is to deliver expert and professional physiotherapy services tailored to the unique needs of each patient.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-2xl flex-1 border border-blue-100">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">10+ Years</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-blue-600">Clinical Experience</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-2xl flex-1 border border-blue-100">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">Master's</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-blue-600">Salford University</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#011d3b] mb-4">Our Mission</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">To provide accessible, high-quality, and evidence-based physiotherapy that empowers individuals to overcome physical barriers and achieve their full potential for health and independence.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#011d3b] mb-4">Our Philosophy</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">We believe in identifying the root cause, not just the symptom. By combining hands-on treatment with expert education, we ensure our patients don't just get better—they stay better.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why Movement Science (Moved from Home) -->
    <div class="bg-white py-20 pb-10">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
                <div class="md:w-1/2">
                    <img src="/images/about.jpg" alt="Movement Science Physiotherapy" class="rounded-3xl shadow-xl">
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#011d3b] mb-6">Why Movement Science</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        Movement science has an excellent team of highly qualified physiotherapists working close to you, provider expert physical and rehabilitation treatments with the aim to restore pain, movement, and strength, enabling our patients not only to achieve their goals and perform better, but also to prevent future injury.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why Choose Us -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-[#011d3b] mb-16">Why Choose Movement Science?</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-home text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Home Visit Expertise</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">We bring the clinic to you, ensuring professional care in the environment where you feel most comfortable.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-brain text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Specialised Care</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Expertise in neurological, cardiorespiratory, and MSK conditions ensures a truly holistic recovery path.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Evidence-Based</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">All treatments are rooted in the latest clinical research and tailored to your specific recovery goals.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
      <%- include('footer') %>
</body>
<style>
    * {
  font-family: Nunito, sans-serif;
}

h5 {
